## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to design a lightweight edge optimization with clear cost/benefit trade-offs, focusing on data movement, energy, and privacy in mobile environments.

## Key Concepts

- Content-based fingerprinting
- Bloom filters for on-device dedup
- Bandwidth vs CPU energy trade-offs
- Privacy considerations and optional cloud verification

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo: compute hash and check Bloom filter
function canSend(record, bloom) {
  const h = hash(record); // deterministic fingerprint
  if (bloom.mightContain(h)) return false;
  bloom.add(h);
  return true;
}
```

## Follow-up Questions

- How would you estimate Bloom filter false positive rate given device memory constraints?
- How would you rollout to mitigate drift in data patterns and ensure continued value?

